) VALUES (
  'overnight-resurfacing-five-roads-until-15-december-2026-11-11',
  'Overnight resurfacing on five northern-suburbs roads runs until 15 December',
  'Traffic', '2026-11-11', 'Getaway', 'https://www.getaway.co.za/news/december-roadworks-set-to-affect-five-cape-town-suburbs/',
  'The City is resurfacing roads in Blaauwberg, Bothasig, Panorama, Parow and Bellville overnight, with most new sections starting on 23 November and completion targeted for 15 December.',
  'The City of Cape Town''s Urban Mobility Directorate has confirmed a run of overnight road works across several northern suburbs. Crews will work between 19:00 and 05:30 so that daytime traffic is disturbed as little as possible, although nearby residents may still hear construction noise during the night.

Work has already begun on Otto du Plessis Drive, in the stretch from Blaauwberg Circle to Sir David Baird Road, with traffic held and released in turn. Vryburger Avenue in Bothasig and Rothschild Avenue in Panorama had preparatory work from 11 November, with resurfacing from 23 November. Frans Conradie Drive in Parow is due to be resurfaced from 23 November, and work on Suikerbos Road in Bellville is also due to start on 23 November.

The teams will mill off the old asphalt, lay new hot-mix asphalt and replace damaged kerbs. The City is aiming to finish by 15 December 2026, but says the programme depends on the weather and could be affected by unforeseen delays.

Motorists who travel these routes at night are advised to allow extra time, use alternative routes where they can and take care when approaching work zones.',
  NULL, NULL, NULL,
  '["https://www.getaway.co.za/news/december-roadworks-set-to-affect-five-cape-town-suburbs/", "https://capetimes.co.za/2026-11-11-five-cape-town-suburbs-face-overnight-roadworks-until-december-15/"]',
  'agent'
);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO news (
